==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat here is THE FOLIVOREAN; you can take every unit down with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. Other Behemoth Slayers, long range units and [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|anti-Aku units]] should help.

